@startuml FeedPost_Sequence
actor User
participant Browser
participant AppServer
participant DB
participant FileSystem

User -> Browser: opens Feed -> taps "New Post"
Browser -> AppServer: POST /feed/create (images + caption)

' 패턴 적용된 흐름:
'  - PostFactory (Factory)로 FeedPost 생성
'  - PostRepository (Repository)로 저장
'  - FeedPublisher (Observer Subject)로 팔로워에게 알림

User -> Browser: opens Feed -> taps "New Post"
Browser -> AppServer: POST /feed/create (images + caption)
AppServer -> ConcretePostFactory: create("FeedPost", data)
ConcretePostFactory --> AppServer: FeedPost(instance)
AppServer -> PostService: createPost(feedPost)
PostService -> PostRepository: save(feedPost)
PostRepository -> DB: INSERT FeedPost
DB --> PostRepository: feed_post_id
PostRepository --> PostService: saved post
PostService -> FileSystem: save images -> filenames
FileSystem --> PostService: filenames
PostService -> PostRepository: update images
PostService -> FeedPublisher: notify(event: new_feed_post)
FeedPublisher -> FollowerObserver: update(event)
FollowerObserver --> DB: persist notification (optional)
PostService --> Browser: 201 Created (redirect to feed)

Note right of PostService: PostService acts as Facade; PostRepository encapsulates DB access

@enduml
